    {
      "id": "claim_8fe8a66f71974b68a9979c2321571f55",
      "statement": "packages/shared/src/protocol.ts is the single source of truth for cross-domain protocol shapes: it defines the WebSocketEnvelope/BrijioEnvelope routing envelope with optional per-call target.browserInstanceId and target.tabId, BrijioRole (extension|mcp) and the auth handshake, BrowserCapability names and BrowserPresence, tab-listing shapes, and staged file-upload/download/fetch shapes. Per AGENTS.md these definitions live only in packages/shared and must not be duplicated; the MCP server's servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts imports canonical types from @brijio/shared rather than redefining them.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://AGENTS.md#L113-L131",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9ae7320ad8bc011703475324728a2dcf3438bf63a98b0e3063d3a4c8ba9ffc08:"
