    {
      "id": "claim_f1cf774f23224adda9c7c3a571940db0",
      "statement": "The MCP server (servers/mcp/src/mcp-server.ts) registers the current tool set: list_browsers, list_tabs, read_current_page, click_element, fill_input, fill_editable, set_checked, select_options, submit_form, upload_file, navigate_to_url, open_tab (ADR 0063), perform_batch, download_status, download_file, fetch_resource, and capture_screenshot (ADR 0064, the only tool returning MCP image content). Results use a structured { ok, data|error } envelope.",
