      "id": "claim_837485c4486c4f9c8687f0dbb10c9634",
      "statement": "Chrome (clients/extensions/chrome) is the first implementation using the chrome.* namespace, MV3, and runtime optional_host_permissions. Safari (clients/extensions/safari) is a parallel implementation: per ADR 0019 and ADR 0051 it uses the browser.* namespace, MV2 background scripts, platform-specific persistence, and text-only badges, with the entrypoint in clients/extensions/safari/src/background-entry.ts wiring Safari adapters into the shared controller.",
